---
layout: layout.njk
title: Resources
description: Reference materials for Autonomous Software Engineering.
---
<header class="page-header">
  <p class="eyebrow">Reading and tools</p>
  <h1>Resources</h1>
  <p>Core references from the course proposal.</p>
</header>

<section class="section-rule">
  <ol class="reference-list">
    {% for reference in course.references %}
      <li><span>{{ reference.year }}</span><div><strong>{% if reference.url %}<a href="{{ reference.url }}">{{ reference.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ reference.title }}{% endif %}</strong><small>{{ reference.author }}{% if reference.note %} · {{ reference.note }}{% endif %}</small></div></li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
